course: dictionary
lesson: 12318
title: Corrode: slow damage
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: To corrode means to slowly eat away or damage something. Metal often corrodes, which is what rust is. «Salt water corrodes the car» means the salt slowly damages the metal, bit by bit, until it is weaker.
explain: The word can also describe things that are not metal. «Lies corrode trust» means lies slowly wear away trust. The sentence tells you what is harmed (trust), and the word lies is the cause. You can see the damage happening slowly, not all at once.
explain: To check your meaning, swap in a simpler word such as damage or weaken. «Salt water damages the car» still makes sense, so you have the right idea. Remember the forms: corrodes, corroded, corroding.
fact: «Corrode» is a verb: corrodes, corroded, corroding.
fact: Iron nails rust, or corrode, when they are in water and air together.
fact: Paint, oil and a zinc coating (called galvanising) protect metal from corroding.
fact: Salty roads in winter and sea air can corrode cars and bikes.
fact: «Corroded pipes» and «a corroded battery» are damaged and eaten away over time.
exercise: «Salt water corrodes the car.» What does corrodes mean here? | *Slowly damages and eats away | Cleans and shines | Makes very hot | Hides from view
exercise: In a science test, iron nails rust, or corrode, fastest when they are in what? | Sugar | A sealed jar with no air | *Water and air together | Dry air only
exercise: «Lies corrode trust.» Which word could replace corrode with the same meaning? | Build | *Slowly weaken | Measure | Polish
test: «The old pipes had corroded, so the water turned brown.» What does corroded mean here? | *Damaged and eaten away slowly | Heated up quickly | Painted bright | Filled with air
test: Which protects iron from corroding? | Wrapping it in paper | Stacking it dry | Leaving it in the sun | *Paint or a zinc coating
exam: Which sentence uses corrode correctly? | *Sea air will corrode the old bike | The bike corroded happy | Corrode the sunny bike | The bike is corrode today
